# Normalize line endings.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with the default `core.autocrlf=true`
# checks every file out as CRLF, while Prettier's `endOfLine: "lf"` (its
# default, and what the repo is formatted with) then flags all ~370
# source files. That made `pnpm format:check` — and therefore the
# .githooks/pre-commit hook — fail for every Windows contributor.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` keeps LF in the working tree on all platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.node   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.db     binary
*.sqlite binary
